(6202333, 916271, 69325, '<td valign="top">this is going to be a frustrating challenge for you i think, if voters only saw the top half of the image it would be knockin em dead, the bottom half however....well I am sure you know what i am thinking. it''s also too bad the hand placement would not let you crop in tighter on the left so as not to see the edge of the sheet......i gotta get that junk listed on craigslist so i can get that lighting ordered and you wont be so limited in your creativity. if i were to vote on this i would say 10 for the top half and 5 for the bottom, it just goes from magical to mundane as the eyes travel down the shot....An A+ on the concept tho.</td>', 'this is going to be a frustrating challenge for you i think, if voters only saw the top half of the image it would be knockin em dead, the bottom half however....well I am sure you know what i am thinking. it''s also too bad the hand placement would not let you crop in tighter on the left so as not to see the edge of the sheet......i gotta get that junk listed on craigslist so i can get that lighting ordered and you wont be so limited in your creativity. if i were to vote on this i would say 10 for the top half and 5 for the bottom, it just goes from magical to mundane as the eyes travel down the shot....An A+ on the concept tho.', '2010-10-27 04:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
