(6203093, 916435, 114225, '<td valign="top">Funny, with the position of your jeans, it looks much more like you are laying on the ground..<br/>Either way, this photo isn''t really telling me much of a story about why you are "jumping" so it''s not really resonating with me.</td>', 'Funny, with the position of your jeans, it looks much more like you are laying on the ground..Either way, this photo isn''t really telling me much of a story about why you are "jumping" so it''s not really resonating with me.', '2010-10-27 21:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6203095, 916459, 114225, '<td valign="top">I am just not seeing much of Jump in this photo. I see one exposure of you sitting on the ground, and another of you slipping on something.</td>', 'I am just not seeing much of Jump in this photo. I see one exposure of you sitting on the ground, and another of you slipping on something.', '2010-10-27 21:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6203097, 916085, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the rule of thirds and negative space. I''m not a big fan of the color cast that was chosen for this photo.</td>', 'Nice use of the rule of thirds and negative space. I''m not a big fan of the color cast that was chosen for this photo.', '2010-10-27 21:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6203098, 916339, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a good scene to go for in this challenge. Overall, I''m not caring for the photo too much.  I''m seeing some heavy shadows on the person, which is indicating a flash unit. So if a flash was used, why is the sky so blown out?</td>', 'This is a good scene to go for in this challenge. Overall, I''m not caring for the photo too much.  I''m seeing some heavy shadows on the person, which is indicating a flash unit. So if a flash was used, why is the sky so blown out?', '2010-10-27 21:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6203099, 916448, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great idea for this challenge, and well captured. Great sharpness, depth of field, and composition.</td>', 'Great idea for this challenge, and well captured. Great sharpness, depth of field, and composition.', '2010-10-27 21:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6203100, 916290, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and composition of this photo.</td>', 'I really like the colors and composition of this photo.', '2010-10-27 21:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6203101, 916303, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The use of black and white here is very good, as is the lighting and use of negative space.</td>', 'Great capture. The use of black and white here is very good, as is the lighting and use of negative space.', '2010-10-27 21:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6203102, 916375, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good thing he saved it, the net sure wouldn''t!<br/>I actually think the missing net is a big thing here, it''s taking away some of the realism. Also, I think it would have been good to use a small aperture to blur some of the distracting background elements.</td>', 'Good thing he saved it, the net sure wouldn''t!I actually think the missing net is a big thing here, it''s taking away some of the realism. Also, I think it would have been good to use a small aperture to blur some of the distracting background elements.', '2010-10-27 21:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
