(6203689, 915713, 29777, '<td valign="top">This is a clever idea. I like the staging very much. The highlights on the right are a bit distracting. If these were toned down a bit I think the transition from the reflection to the background would work better. It took me a while to figure out what was in the frame. I like the blur to show motion, but this may be too much blur.</td>', 'This is a clever idea. I like the staging very much. The highlights on the right are a bit distracting. If these were toned down a bit I think the transition from the reflection to the background would work better. It took me a while to figure out what was in the frame. I like the blur to show motion, but this may be too much blur.', '2010-10-28 17:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
