(6203855, 916381, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nicely centered in the frame. I like the wide angle perspective on this rather than filling the frame with the subject.</td>', 'Nicely centered in the frame. I like the wide angle perspective on this rather than filling the frame with the subject.', '2010-10-28 21:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
