(6204568, 916384, 42198, '<td valign="top">Is this in a car? - Interesting idea, but looks a bit... cluttered. Pity you didn''t have these speakers in an Irene-style studio setting.</td>', 'Is this in a car? - Interesting idea, but looks a bit... cluttered. Pity you didn''t have these speakers in an Irene-style studio setting.', '2010-10-29 19:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204572, 916489, 42198, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this I really like. Most probably the model. I bet she did some damage to that toe when she landed. Nicely composed and sharp.</td>', 'There''s something about this I really like. Most probably the model. I bet she did some damage to that toe when she landed. Nicely composed and sharp.', '2010-10-29 19:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204574, 916465, 42198, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to see the girl in this. Pity all that stuff in the background is there, it detracts.</td>', 'Took me a while to see the girl in this. Pity all that stuff in the background is there, it detracts.', '2010-10-29 19:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204577, 916482, 42198, '<td valign="top">I love this, especially whatever you did with the saturation to get that over-the-top edited look. Quite surreal and out of the box. I barely have any idea what I''m looking at. Are they leaves? Anyway, I love it. 10 from me.</td>', 'I love this, especially whatever you did with the saturation to get that over-the-top edited look. Quite surreal and out of the box. I barely have any idea what I''m looking at. Are they leaves? Anyway, I love it. 10 from me.', '2010-10-29 19:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204580, 916347, 42198, '<td valign="top">Some big problems with artifacts here. But I''m sure the 10 comments above and below me will say more-or-less the same. Pity, cause it looks like you took some effort setting this up.</td>', 'Some big problems with artifacts here. But I''m sure the 10 comments above and below me will say more-or-less the same. Pity, cause it looks like you took some effort setting this up.', '2010-10-29 19:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204583, 915968, 42198, '<td valign="top">Technically it''s great, lighting is good, composition, and sharpness, all good. But, to be honest, there is nothing here to hold my interest.</td>', 'Technically it''s great, lighting is good, composition, and sharpness, all good. But, to be honest, there is nothing here to hold my interest.', '2010-10-29 19:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204585, 916427, 42198, '<td valign="top">I wish I was that happy every time I bought new clothes. Lighting''s a bit flat, and I''d love to see the expression on their face. Still, that''s a really high jump.</td>', 'I wish I was that happy every time I bought new clothes. Lighting''s a bit flat, and I''d love to see the expression on their face. Still, that''s a really high jump.', '2010-10-29 19:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204587, 916255, 42198, '<td valign="top">That weird architecture in the background actually has me very interested in this photo...</td>', 'That weird architecture in the background actually has me very interested in this photo...', '2010-10-29 19:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204588, 915714, 121073, '<td valign="top">I really like the depth in this shot - great pose too!</td>', 'I really like the depth in this shot - great pose too!', '2010-10-29 19:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204589, 915591, 42198, '<td valign="top">He''s either a giant kid about to crush the barn, or a normal size kid jumping between two tyres. I''m going with the latter.<br/> <br/>On the technical side, there seems to be a sharpness/focus issue.</td>', 'He''s either a giant kid about to crush the barn, or a normal size kid jumping between two tyres. I''m going with the latter. On the technical side, there seems to be a sharpness/focus issue.', '2010-10-29 19:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204590, 916290, 121073, '<td valign="top">Great jump combined with a nice sunset - love it!<br/>Wonder if it''d been better if there was more space between the foot and the right edge of the shot though.</td>', 'Great jump combined with a nice sunset - love it!Wonder if it''d been better if there was more space between the foot and the right edge of the shot though.', '2010-10-29 19:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204591, 916077, 121073, '<td valign="top">Looks like you found the perfect location to take the shot!</td>', 'Looks like you found the perfect location to take the shot!', '2010-10-29 19:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204592, 916247, 42198, '<td valign="top">Water drops. Again. Or are they ice or glass? - Anyway, I''m giving you a decent score cause you''ve gone with the abstract angle on this, which I like.</td>', 'Water drops. Again. Or are they ice or glass? - Anyway, I''m giving you a decent score cause you''ve gone with the abstract angle on this, which I like.', '2010-10-29 19:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204594, 916339, 42198, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and well captured (wish I could see his face though)<br/> <br/>Is it over-sharpened?</td>', 'Nice lighting and well captured (wish I could see his face though) Is it over-sharpened?', '2010-10-29 19:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204595, 916493, 42198, '<td valign="top">A 9, for making a corridor interesting.</td>', 'A 9, for making a corridor interesting.', '2010-10-29 19:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204597, 916032, 42198, '<td valign="top">Pretty good - I hope he didn''t impale himself on that bone. Nicely composed.<br/> <br/>Is this a zebra with a kangaroo identity issue?</td>', 'Pretty good - I hope he didn''t impale himself on that bone. Nicely composed. Is this a zebra with a kangaroo identity issue?', '2010-10-29 19:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
