(6204601, 916214, 42198, '<td valign="top">Ah, so we''re no doubt going to see a ''why do people vote down flags'' thread when voting''s over?<br/> <br/>Nice colours though. Pity we can''t see his face. And did I just give myself away as a non-American with my spelling of ''colour'' ?</td>', 'Ah, so we''re no doubt going to see a ''why do people vote down flags'' thread when voting''s over? Nice colours though. Pity we can''t see his face. And did I just give myself away as a non-American with my spelling of ''colour'' ?', '2010-10-29 19:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204603, 916290, 42198, '<td valign="top">This looks so Judi-ish it''s unreal. Yeah, this will be front page alright...<br/> <br/>Just one small flaw, no space on the right hand side behind her foot.</td>', 'This looks so Judi-ish it''s unreal. Yeah, this will be front page alright... Just one small flaw, no space on the right hand side behind her foot.', '2010-10-29 19:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204604, 916309, 42198, '<td valign="top">Are you trying to confuse my already befuddled head? How many legs does that guy have, or are they arms?</td>', 'Are you trying to confuse my already befuddled head? How many legs does that guy have, or are they arms?', '2010-10-29 19:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204605, 916317, 42198, '<td valign="top">Do you have many batteries as friends?<br/> <br/>It''s a long jump to make the connection here. But I''ll make a leap of faith and trust this isn''t a shoehorn.</td>', 'Do you have many batteries as friends? It''s a long jump to make the connection here. But I''ll make a leap of faith and trust this isn''t a shoehorn.', '2010-10-29 19:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204606, 916400, 42198, '<td valign="top">So who''s doing the jumping? - Either the girl is, and the dog has very long back legs. Or the dog is, and he''s about to knock the girl over. <br/> <br/>It''d have been great to see their feet and put some context to this.</td>', 'So who''s doing the jumping? - Either the girl is, and the dog has very long back legs. Or the dog is, and he''s about to knock the girl over.  It''d have been great to see their feet and put some context to this.', '2010-10-29 19:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204610, 916459, 42198, '<td valign="top">''fraid so.<br/> <br/>Are you falling up, or falling down, and from where to where? Looks like the back door of a garage, or is that a wardrobe door you''re holding onto?<br/> <br/>Actually, this reminds me of Eric Cantona the footballer with his famous karate kick.</td>', '''fraid so. Are you falling up, or falling down, and from where to where? Looks like the back door of a garage, or is that a wardrobe door you''re holding onto? Actually, this reminds me of Eric Cantona the footballer with his famous karate kick.', '2010-10-29 19:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204611, 916303, 42198, '<td valign="top">This is cool, there are some nice contrasty effects going on.</td>', 'This is cool, there are some nice contrasty effects going on.', '2010-10-29 19:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
