(6204614, 915714, 42198, '<td valign="top">I love the polaroid style processing. Not sure if that''s what you intended, but it works well.</td>', 'I love the polaroid style processing. Not sure if that''s what you intended, but it works well.', '2010-10-29 19:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
