(6204791, 916137, 24511, '<td valign="top">Pole jumping creative and top two on my list.  I gave a 9 but would have scored 10 in a heart beat if a little bit of the left frame was cropped out.  Fantastic favorite photo.</td>', 'Pole jumping creative and top two on my list.  I gave a 9 but would have scored 10 in a heart beat if a little bit of the left frame was cropped out.  Fantastic favorite photo.', '2010-10-30 01:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204795, 916435, 24511, '<td valign="top">Ha ha!  You took the words right out of my mouth.  I was thinking hanging or what... Then you pulled me in with your vague backgroundness.  Humour is the lifeblood of my higher scoring senses.  Changes your 4 into a nine.  Pulling me into a moment of laughter makes you my hero photo of this whole challenge.  Go make my day and others too.  Thanks.</td>', 'Ha ha!  You took the words right out of my mouth.  I was thinking hanging or what... Then you pulled me in with your vague backgroundness.  Humour is the lifeblood of my higher scoring senses.  Changes your 4 into a nine.  Pulling me into a moment of laughter makes you my hero photo of this whole challenge.  Go make my day and others too.  Thanks.', '2010-10-30 01:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204799, 916458, 24511, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I just voted a nine for feet and now you''ve got me voting for a social workers nightmare.  Serious subject matter, call for help could use a little more color, nifty red leather shoes and coastguard bellow.  Good luck.</td>', 'I can''t believe I just voted a nine for feet and now you''ve got me voting for a social workers nightmare.  Serious subject matter, call for help could use a little more color, nifty red leather shoes and coastguard bellow.  Good luck.', '2010-10-30 01:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
