(6208443, 916339, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice stop motion. Great lighting. On one hand I like how you just catch a glimpse of his eye, on the other I''d like to a bit more of his expression. Only real complaint is that it may be a bit over-sharpened. SLightly too contrasty. But nice job.</td>', 'Nice stop motion. Great lighting. On one hand I like how you just catch a glimpse of his eye, on the other I''d like to a bit more of his expression. Only real complaint is that it may be a bit over-sharpened. SLightly too contrasty. But nice job.', '2010-11-02 10:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208444, 916493, 108069, '<td valign="top">Exactly the kind of photo I love. But it''s a bit of a stretch here I believe. At least without Buck Rogers or the like somewhere in the scene. Still, I do really like it, so no penalty. Blur works well. I usually go sharp for these, but it hasn''t helpd. The blur really draws the eye in smoothly like a dream... or a dimension jump I suppose.</td>', 'Exactly the kind of photo I love. But it''s a bit of a stretch here I believe. At least without Buck Rogers or the like somewhere in the scene. Still, I do really like it, so no penalty. Blur works well. I usually go sharp for these, but it hasn''t helpd. The blur really draws the eye in smoothly like a dream... or a dimension jump I suppose.', '2010-11-02 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208445, 916392, 108069, '<td valign="top">Razor sharp with a nice depth of field, and a perfectly focused and exposed photo of a ridiculously boring subject. I have chosen to reward you on your technical merits, because technically it is flawless. Great shot for a textbook. For better or worse ;)</td>', 'Razor sharp with a nice depth of field, and a perfectly focused and exposed photo of a ridiculously boring subject. I have chosen to reward you on your technical merits, because technically it is flawless. Great shot for a textbook. For better or worse ;)', '2010-11-02 10:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
