(6209567, 916317, 116649, '<td valign="top">If you would have told me when I submitted my first entry on a dare how difficult it would be to earn a 6 out of 10 on any given photo, I would have bet you money...   and would still be paying off my losses!  I am learning much here, thank you for all the comments, I learn something from each and every one.  This crowd has Sparked my creativity indeed!</td>', 'If you would have told me when I submitted my first entry on a dare how difficult it would be to earn a 6 out of 10 on any given photo, I would have bet you money...   and would still be paying off my losses!  I am learning much here, thank you for all the comments, I learn something from each and every one.  This crowd has Sparked my creativity indeed!', '2010-11-03 01:20:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6209575, 916482, 54645, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue! Love the textured movement.</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue! Love the textured movement.', '2010-11-03 01:37:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6209576, 916290, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Judi! That is an awesome shot and an awesome achievement. I gave you 10 but didn''t even imagine that it was a self portrait.</td>', 'Congratulations Judi! That is an awesome shot and an awesome achievement. I gave you 10 but didn''t even imagine that it was a self portrait.', '2010-11-03 01:37:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6209600, 916146, 54645, '<td valign="top">Enjoyable blur, but in particular, I like movement from 2D to 3D, are the feet grounded or airborne, struggling to find yourself.</td>', 'Enjoyable blur, but in particular, I like movement from 2D to 3D, are the feet grounded or airborne, struggling to find yourself.', '2010-11-03 01:54:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6209649, 916077, 61084, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on your first ribbon. I was thinking, as I voted on this, "I wish it were vertically oriented, this looks awkward..." but I guess that didn''t hurt you :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I called this to ribbon, and I''m glad it did. I do agree with Robert here though that the landscape orientation was a little awkward to the eye. Not that it''s a bad thing because it can add to an image as much as take away from it. In this case it more than likely helped as you got your ribbon which again...I knew you would. LOL. :) Congrats!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: Congrats on your first ribbon. I was thinking, as I voted on this, "I wish it were vertically oriented, this looks awkward..." but I guess that didn''t hurt you :-)   I called this to ribbon, and I''m glad it did. I do agree with Robert here though that the landscape orientation was a little awkward to the eye. Not that it''s a bad thing because it can add to an image as much as take away from it. In this case it more than likely helped as you got your ribbon which again...I knew you would. LOL. :) Congrats! ', '2010-11-03 02:24:35.000000', NULL, 0),
