(6212380, 916146, 104809, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> LOL!  Watch out, Ben.  Chris is going to steal your thunder, LOL!!!</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ooooh!  I didn''t know there would be <i>thunder</i>!  Do you get to control that at will, or does it just kind of happen randomly?  ;-p</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: LOL!  Watch out, Ben.  Chris is going to steal your thunder, LOL!!!  Ooooh!  I didn''t know there would be thunder!  Do you get to control that at will, or does it just kind of happen randomly?  ;-p', '2010-11-04 23:57:42.000000', NULL, 0),
