(6212559, 916307, 59029, '<td valign="top">Very good capture taken in the warmup ring.  Glad to see the super-correct posture and like that I can even see that the horse is a splinter-belly :-)  Good framing with the jump standards.  Fantastic light on the horse<br/> <br/>I can see why some find the towers distracting but as it was a Basic challenge there wasn''t much else you could do.  Like the b/w, I suspect those nasty ol towers are red and white.<br/> <br/>Good work!  Do you know who the horse and rider are?</td>', 'Very good capture taken in the warmup ring.  Glad to see the super-correct posture and like that I can even see that the horse is a splinter-belly :-)  Good framing with the jump standards.  Fantastic light on the horse I can see why some find the towers distracting but as it was a Basic challenge there wasn''t much else you could do.  Like the b/w, I suspect those nasty ol towers are red and white. Good work!  Do you know who the horse and rider are?', '2010-11-05 06:22:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6212665, 916077, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You ARE stantheman!  I''d never have been brave enough to dangle with the camera!  Good shot!</td>', 'Wow!  You ARE stantheman!  I''d never have been brave enough to dangle with the camera!  Good shot!', '2010-11-05 09:02:45.000000', NULL, 0),
