(6214021, 916077, 91372, '<td valign="top">Just to answer Chicagrafo''s question, yeah, I tried this exact shot maybe 6 or 7 times and this is the closest I could line him up to the board. It probably had something to do with the fact that the block i was hanging off of wasn''t exactly centered with the board. Appreciate the criticism though, really.</td>', 'Just to answer Chicagrafo''s question, yeah, I tried this exact shot maybe 6 or 7 times and this is the closest I could line him up to the board. It probably had something to do with the fact that the block i was hanging off of wasn''t exactly centered with the board. Appreciate the criticism though, really.', '2010-11-06 20:00:25.000000', NULL, 0),
